# Reloved UI Components

Reuse existing primitives. Do not invent parallel button/input/card systems.

- Buttons: `@/components/ui/Button`
- Inputs: `@/components/ui/Input`, `@/components/ui/Textarea`
- Cards: `@/components/ui/Card` for generic containers; poster listings use a WallCard pattern
- Tape / FREE stamp: `@/components/assets/RelovedAssets` (`Tape`, `FreeStamp`)
- Images: `@/components/ui/SafeImage`
- Icons: `lucide-react` only. Never invent inline SVGs for standard icons.

## Button

Sharp corners, display type, tactile press. Variants:

- `primary`: `bg-foreground text-background`
- `secondary`: `bg-accent-green text-foreground`
- `outline`: `bg-white text-foreground`
- `danger`: `bg-accent-red text-white`
- `ghost`: no border/shadow, `hover:bg-black/5`

Shared: `font-display font-black uppercase tracking-widest border-2 border-foreground rounded-none shadow-[4px_4px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] hover:shadow-none hover:translate-x-[4px] hover:translate-y-[4px] active:scale-[0.98]`

When editing `Button.tsx`, replace `rounded-full` and soft hover-only styles with this system.

## Forms

```tsx
<label className="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-foreground">Field Label *</label>
<input className="h-12 w-full bg-background px-4 text-sm font-medium border-2 border-foreground rounded-none placeholder:text-foreground-muted/60 focus:outline-none focus:bg-white shadow-[2px_2px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] focus:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] transition-all" />
```

Selects use the same border/shadow/`rounded-none` treatment. No pill/`rounded-[1.5rem]` wrappers.

## Poster / WallCard

Listings simulate flyers on a wall:

- Alternating tilts: `-rotate-1`, `rotate-2`, `-rotate-2`, `rotate-3`
- Hover: `group-hover:rotate-0 group-hover:scale-[1.03]`
- `<Tape />` at top center
- Status: `<FreeStamp />` (available), yellow `BEING MATCHED`, pink `GIVEN • RELOVED`
- Card chrome: `bg-white border-2 border-foreground shadow-[5px_5px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] rounded-none`

